WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Narrator: The final whistle.

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:07.700
Narrator: Thousands of happy fans, tired and excited, and not one of them is looking at the cars.

3
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.900
Narrator: Majed wants to help, so he waves them across.

4
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.800
Narrator: But two cars are still moving.

5
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.530
Narrator: Rewind.

6
00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:19.830
Narrator: Noura holds the fans on the pavement.

7
00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:24.130
Narrator: The crowd is growing, so she radios her supervisor early.

8
00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:32.460
Narrator: She waits until every car has stopped, then calls the fans across together.
